description = 1.12 修复：设置下发只在 HTTP 2xx 时才记签名（原来 nil/4xx/5xx 也算成功，之后再也不重试）；stop 时清除全局单例 key（否则 launcher 会误判服务仍在运行而不再拉起）。1.11：HTTP handler 上限提升至 256；支持自动与定时息屏、按键或摇动唤醒、三组重复闹钟及 MP3 铃声，并修复服务重载后重复触发
description_en = Version 1.12 records the display-settings signature only on HTTP 2xx and clears its global singleton key on stop so Launcher restarts it. Version 1.11 raises the HTTP handler limit to 256, adds automatic and scheduled screen-off, key or motion wake, three repeating alarms, MP3 sounds, and reload-safe alarm state.
